        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m2g3" value="&lt;b&gt;What the EU report reads&lt;/b&gt; (one data source per table, the whole folder). table = Plan_OPT_EU, Time_Utilisation_EU, Daily_Losses_EU. source = provideam or sih: written by the flow of that source, only with the lines whose source in Config is that source. A site with one line on sih has two files per month here, each with its own lines" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
